    "explanation_en": "To investigate activity using the unified audit log inside Microsoft Defender for Cloud Apps, you must first connect Microsoft 365 as an API-connected app (the \"Microsoft 365 connector\", formerly the Office 365 connector) under Settings > Cloud Apps > Connected apps. This connector uses the Office 365 Management API to pull admin, user, and sign-in activity into Defender for Cloud Apps so it becomes available for investigation and policy correlation. User enrichment (A) only adds HR attributes to identities, the Azure connector (B) covers Azure platform activity rather than Microsoft 365 audit data, and automatic log upload (D) is used for discovering Shadow IT from firewall/proxy logs, not for Microsoft 365 audit events."
