    "explanation_en": "Microsoft Defender for Identity monitors on-premises Active Directory signals and has a dedicated 'Suspected identity theft (pass-the-ticket)' detection (mapped to MITRE T1550.003) for exactly this lateral-movement technique, where a stolen Kerberos ticket is reused on a different computer. Defender for Cloud Apps focuses on SaaS/cloud app activity, Defender for Office 365 focuses on email/collaboration threats, and Purview eDiscovery is a content-search tool, none of which provide on-prem AD identity-based lateral movement detection."
