    "explanation_en": "The \"Share endpoint alerts with Microsoft Compliance Center\" advanced feature in Defender for Endpoint forwards endpoint alerts and their triage/remediation status into the Microsoft Purview compliance portal, where they enrich insider risk management policies and investigations. Web content filtering controls site access and is unrelated to insider risk, scoping correlation to device groups only limits automated investigation grouping, and streamlined device connectivity is a networking/onboarding optimization with no Purview integration role."
