    "explanation_en": "An automation rule's Run playbook action only lists playbooks whose Logic App trigger type matches the automation rule's own trigger (alert-trigger rules can only run alert-triggered playbooks; incident-trigger rules can only run incident-triggered playbooks). Since the rule uses the alert trigger but the existing playbook starts with an incident trigger, the playbook is hidden from the picker; using or rebuilding the playbook with an alert trigger is the direct fix. Reordering the rule, converting the playbook to a workbook, or moving it to the Sentinel resource group do not address the trigger mismatch that is actually hiding it."
